msgid ""
"In this chapter you will be guided in using &krusader; effectively with a "
"mouse "
"and to configure mouse gestures through KHotKeys. By simply clicking the "
"mouse "
"you can select different sections of &krusader;. Another chapter describes "
"the "
"selection modes, and how you can configure them: <link "
"linkend=\"konfig-selection_modes\">Selection Mode</link>"
msgstr ""

